-| Incident field $u_{\rm inc}$ | Uniform (constant) |
-| Helmholtz Green's function | Lensing kernel $K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})$ |
-| Wavenumber $k > 0$ | $k \to 0$ (Poisson limit) |
