-### 15.3 The Picard Condition
-
-The equation $F\kappa = \gamma_{\rm true}$ has a solution $\kappa \in L^2(\Omega)$ if and only if:
-
-$$\sum_i \left(\frac{|\langle \gamma_{\rm true}, \mathbf{u}_i\rangle|}{\sigma_i}\right)^2 < \infty$$
